Title: THE WHISPERING ASYLUM
Genre: Psychological Horror
Recommended Style: Expressionist Horror & Film Noir

INT. BLACKWOOD SANATORIUM - SUB-CELLAR 4 - MIDNIGHT
[STYLE: Expressionist Horror | LIGHTING: Jagged Diagonal Shadows, Flickering Bulb]

Extreme Dutch angles. Distorted corridor walls angle inward like the ribcage of an ancient beast.

DR. JONATHAN REED (30s, disheveled suit, cracked spectacles) holds a kerosene lantern with trembling fingers.

The shadows on the wall do not match his body; they dance independently, extending elongated claws toward the ceiling.

VOICE (O.S.)
(whispering from the ventilation grate)
Did you think locking the asylum doors would keep the patients in, Doctor? Or keep you with us?
